176
00:13:37,460 --> 00:13:56,176
You should now be able to say:

177
00:13:56,516 --> 00:14:01,499
A subtree is the dependency's files as
ordinary blobs under a prefix in my own

178
00:14:01,539 --> 00:14:03,559
history; a plain clone has them.

179
00:14:03,899 --> 00:14:08,795
The link to upstream is two trailers in a
commit message, so rewriting those commits

180
00:14:08,835 --> 00:14:10,029
