185
00:14:24,615 --> 00:14:29,662
Published as a package: the package manager.
Must be present after a plain clone: a

186
00:14:29,702 --> 00:14:34,197
subtree. Must stay a separate repository:
a submodule with the recommended

187
00:14:34,237 --> 00:14:35,054
